# ZhypLearn — Environment Variables (example)
# Copy to .env.local for local development and fill in real values.
# Never commit .env or .env.local — this file is the only one tracked in git.

# --- Database (Neon PostgreSQL — your own ZhypLearn project, never the CRM's) ---
DATABASE_URL=""

# --- Email notifications (Resend) ---
# Leave unset locally and the app logs "would send" instead of failing —
# the demo-request flow still works end-to-end without a real key.
RESEND_API_KEY=""
